Gour Gopal Roy, IIT Kharagpur. Ironmaking and Steelmaking, NPTEL 113105098. [Official sixty-lecture progression](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/113105098) · [Complete syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/113105098.pdf).

Complete the course, its derivations and worked material, from routes and blast-furnace balances/kinetics through feed preparation, slag reactions, oxygen/electric steelmaking, secondary treatment, inclusions, casting, and direct/smelting reduction. Compare historical and contemporary process evidence without assuming each teaching example describes current operation.

Instructor, syllabus, and complete public lecture layout were verified on 29 October 2026. Record actual run/version and media/component terms; public viewing is distinct from certification, campus assessment access, and permission to redistribute. The course and its source media/data remain external references.

